+## Change log — 0.9.8_Hardened_2
+
+**0.9.8_Hardened_2 closes ODR-018.** It supplies one explicit analysis-root
+contract for the two existing cycle tools. It changes no Ember source-language
+accepted/rejected program set, ownership or lifetime mechanism, ABI, runtime
+object semantics, or static ownership-cycle analysis.
+
+| # | Change | Class | Where |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| H2.1 | `[CLI-18]` defines a package-directory or standalone-file analysis root, and forbids cwd scanning, stale-build fallback, prior-build inference, or arbitrary package selection. | TOOLING HARDENING | XX.1, `[CLI-18]` |
+| H2.2 | `[CLI-17]` and `[WK-9]` use the canonical root; `explain --cycle` gains its required `<path>` argument and the target-resolution/ambiguity contract. | TOOLING HARDENING | XX.1, XXIV H14 |
+| H2.3 | Help, conformance mapping, and decision records identify the one resolver and verify package, standalone, target, invalid-root, and non-fallback behavior. | IMPLEMENTATION EVIDENCE BOUNDARY | XX.1, XX.5 |
+
+**This change log is exhaustive for the 0.9.8_Hardened_2 delta.** The H1
+source-language revision remains the complete 0.9.8 language delta.
